        "date": "2026-01-28T21:58:28Z"
      },
      "message": "feat: add Smepmp extension definition\n\nAdd the Smepmp (PMP Enhancements for memory access and execution\nprevention on Machine mode) extension definition.\n\nSmepmp enhances the Physical Memory Protection mechanism by adding\nthe mseccfg CSR with MML, MMWP, and RLB fields that enable:\n- M-mode memory access restriction (Machine Mode Lockdown)\n- Default-deny policy for M-mode (Machine Mode Whitelist Policy)\n- Debug/boot-time modification of locked rules (Rule Locking Bypass)\n\nThis extension was ratified in December 2021 as part of the\nRISC-V Privileged Specification.\n\nCloses #219",
